{"id":"e63c3a4e8bd71ca4","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-productive-set.md","title":"Productive Set","display":"df-productive-set — Productive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-productive-set","aliases":["68-df-productive-set"],"display":"df-productive-set — Productive Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-natural-number]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"External extension; no productive-set definition located in supplied §§1-20","verification_status":"external-source-unverified","source_proof_status":"not-checked","external_verification_status":"unverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-productive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-productive-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-productive-set — Productive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3368c1852f2a1aa0\" href=\"?note=3368c1852f2a1aa0\" title=\"68-df-natural-number\">68-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"External extension; no productive-set definition located in supplied §§1-20"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-source-unverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"external_verification_status","html":"unverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec},W_e\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec},W_e\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Productive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Productive}\\)</span> 为下式引入的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Productive}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Longrightarrow F(e)\\in A\\setminus W_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Productive}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Longrightarrow F(e)\\in A\\setminus W_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留目录原有的总递归生产函数版本，并补齐 F 的一元全函数类型和 W_e 来源。所供 Shoenfield 原书 §17 采用 creating function 定义 creative，未定位到 productive 这一独立定义；本原子属于外部延伸，未核验外部来源，不作为已核验的书籍证明依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec},W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Productive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Productive}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(W_e\\subseteq A\\Longrightarrow F(e)\\in A\\setminus W_e).","display":true}],"bytes":1357,"backlinks":[{"id":"b933761613d185b9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-productive-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-productive-set]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-productive-set|df-productive-set — Productive Set]]"}],"outgoing":["a82d826d433dcff3","913d52943499d039","3368c1852f2a1aa0"]}